      <h1 class="jr-h1">Menopause Joint Pain: Why It Happens and What Actually Helps</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Most pages on this subject list nine supplements and promise relief. The honest version is shorter: the ache is common and real, oestrogen plausibly explains part of it, and almost none of the supplement trials were run in menopausal women at all.</p>

